      "details": "<p>This in a more precise location for Matilo, based on archeological evidence.\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>Source:\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>Roorda, Iepie. \"De Ontmaskering van Matilo\", <em>Monumenten van Romeins Nederland. Beschermingsagenda Archeologie, 2008</em> , Rijksdienst voor Archeologie, Cultuurlandschap en Monumenten: 2008: 64-69.</p>\r\n<p>Coordinates where obtained using Google Maps.</p>\r\n<p>[On <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://www.livius.org/man-md/matilo/matilo.html\">http://www.livius.org/man-md/matilo/matilo.html</a> it is said that the castellum was built in 47, destroyed, rebuilt, and abandoned in the 3rd century. It would be good to get some references to support this.]</p>",
